---
layout: base.njk
title: Weighing public claims against the evidence
description: Independent, science-first checks of public claims made by authorities, institutions, parties and NGOs in Malta, focused on quality of life and the environment.
permalink: /
styles: [home.css]
---
{%- set H = homeData -%}
<script>
  // Links to the old viewer address (/?view=map, /?group=speaker, /?sel=claim:CC-001) open the viewer on /explore/.
  (function () { var q = location.search;
    if (/[?&](view|group|sel|hide|split|previewTheme)=/.test(q)) location.replace(location.pathname.replace(/\/?$/, "/") + "explore/" + q + location.hash); })();
</script>

<section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="h-hero">
  <h1 id="h-hero">Weighing public claims against the evidence.</h1>
  <p class="lead">An independent record of checks on what authorities, institutions, parties, NGOs and others say in
    Malta about quality of life and the environment: science first, every source archived, every side held to the same
    standard. <span class="meaning">Miżien is Maltese for a scale or balance.</span></p>
  <ul class="home-stats" aria-label="The record so far">
    <li><b>{{ H.total }}</b> claims recorded</li>
    <li><b>{{ H.checked }}</b> checked</li>
    <li><b>{{ H.bodies }}</b> bodies and people</li>
    <li><b>{{ H.places }}</b> places</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="home-cta">
    <a class="btn-primary" href="/explore/">{% icon "map" %}<span>Explore the claims</span></a>
    <a class="btn-ghost" href="/claims/">{% icon "list" %}<span>All claims</span></a>
    <a class="btn-ghost" href="/timeline/">{% icon "clock" %}<span>Timeline</span></a>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="h-mosaic">
  <div class="home-head">
    <h2 id="h-mosaic">From the record</h2>
    <button type="button" class="mosaic-pause" id="mosaic-pause" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Pause</button>
  </div>
  <p class="small home-note">A changing selection of the {{ H.checked }} checks so far. Drafts carry a verdict that may change after
    the body concerned replies.</p>
  <ul class="mosaic" id="mosaic" aria-live="off">
    {%- for c in H.cards.slice(0, 12) %}
    <li class="mcard v-{{ c.v }}">{% include "home-card.njk" %}</li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="h-start">
  <h2 id="h-start">Start with a question</h2>
  <ul class="starters">
    <li><a href="/explore/?view=map"><b>What was claimed about my town?</b><span>Every place a claim is about, on a map of Malta and Gozo. Press a place to read its claims.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/explore/?view=ghanqbuta&amp;group=speaker"><b>Who gets checked, and how do they fare?</b><span>Claims grouped by the kind of body that made them: government, agencies, parties, NGOs, business, the EU.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/explore/?view=ghanqbuta&amp;group=speaker&amp;verdict=not-substantiated,misleading,contradicted"><b>Which claims didn't hold up?</b><span>The claims found Not substantiated, Misleading or Contradicted, grouped by who made them.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/timeline/?lanes=verdict"><b>What has been said, and when?</b><span>Every dated claim on a timeline, one lane per verdict, to see when they cluster.</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="h-recent">
  <h2 id="h-recent">Recently checked</h2>
  <ul class="recent">
    {%- for c in H.recent %}
    <li><a href="{{ c.path }}"><span class="badge v-{{ c.v }}">{% if c.pledge %}Pledge: {% endif %}{{ c.label }}</span>
      <b>{{ c.id }}</b> {{ c.title }}</a><span class="small"> · {{ c.speaker }} · reviewed {{ c.reviewed | ukDate }}</span></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/claims/">All {{ H.total }} claims</a> · <a href="/corrections/">Corrections and changes</a> · <a href="/feed.xml">Updates feed</a></p>
</section>

<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="h-how">
  <h2 id="h-how">How the checks work</h2>
  <div class="home-grid">
    <div class="hcard"><h3>Science first</h3><p>Peer-reviewed literature and independent datasets come before press releases.</p></div>
    <div class="hcard"><h3>Every side</h3><p>Governments, opposition parties, NGOs and developers are held to the same standard.</p></div>
    <div class="hcard"><h3>Right of reply</h3><p>When a check finds a claim Not substantiated, Misleading or Contradicted, the draft goes to the body concerned before wider circulation, and its response is published.</p></div>
    <div class="hcard"><h3>Evidence, not inference</h3><p>A verdict of Misleading or Contradicted requires documents or data that can be shown.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="scale" aria-label="Verdict scale">
    {%- for v in mizien.verdicts %}<span class="badge v-{{ v.slug }}">{{ v.name }}</span>{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="small">How each verdict is reached, with the definitions, evidence grades and confidence levels:
    <a href="/methodology/how-a-verdict-is-reached/">How a verdict is reached</a>. What a verdict means, and what it does not:
    <a href="/about/disclaimer/">What a check represents</a>.</p>
</section>

<script type="application/json" id="mosaic-data">{{ H.cards | dump | replace("<", "\\u003c") | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/home.js" defer></script>
